### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "tanishq",
  "lastName": "trivedi",
  "email": "tanishq@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}

### Login the user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tanishq@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}

### Checkout cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productID": 1,
      "Quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "billingAddressId": 1
}
